  {
    "id": 6002001010010,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すごい……実力のあるアイドルばっかり……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200101/6002001010010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "不安に思う必要はない\r\n今の灯織なら、対等に渡り合えるさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001010020,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、大丈夫です。おかしな話ですが……\r\nなんだか、足がふわふわしているんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200101/6002001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001010030,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "オーディションも仕事もたくさんやってきましたけど……\r\nこんな気持ちになるの、初めてです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200101/6002001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001010040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "この感覚は、いったいなんなんでしょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200101/6002001010040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、わくわくしてるんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001010050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "わくわく……ですか。そうですね。いろんなアイドルと\r\n競えることに、わくわくしてるのかもしれません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200101/6002001010050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "(この状況でわくわくか……成長したな、灯織！)",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その気持ちを大事にな、灯織\r\n楽しんでパフォーマンスしてこい！",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001010060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、行ってきます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
